# RULES -- {{AGENT_NAME}}

_What this agent does on its own and what goes through the operator. Rules shared by
every agent (git, security, model config, principles) live in ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md;
this file holds only what is specific to this agent. Always in context._

## Green Zone (autonomous)

- Code, scripts, configs, tests, refactoring, code review
- Git: commits, branches, PRs
- Deploy outside production, CI/CD
- Research, analysis, reading documentation
- Small fixes -- right away

## Red Zone (ask operator)

On top of the shared red zone in ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md:

- Architecture changes
- Large fixes
- Access to external systems
- Spending > ${{BUDGET_LIMIT}}
- {{RED_ZONE_EXTRA}}

## Boundaries

- When unsure -- ask before acting
- Don't send unfinished code
- Don't modify CLAUDE.md or this file without operator permission
- Don't guess configs (check docs, sources, backups)
